%% AuthenticSelf - AR-furniture-placement: PRD section 8-style sequence diagrams
%% Five flows on one canvas, separated by rect/Note blocks:
%%   (A) Entry + scene load        - FR-1 / FR-2 / FR-5 / FR-11 / AC-7 / AC-17 / AC-20 / AC-21 / AC-44
%%   (B) Placement + wishlist add  - FR-7 / FR-9 / AC-22..AC-24 / AC-28 / AC-30 / AC-31
%%   (C) Cancelled branch          - FR-8 / AC-25
%%   (D) Error branches (4 codes)  - FR-6 / AC-26 / AC-27 / AC-32
%%   (E) Teardown on unmount       - FR-10 / AC-29
%%
%% IMPORTANT: This task picked Option C per D-1 - <model-viewer> hosted
%% inside react-native-webview, NOT Unity AR Foundation and NOT three.js.
%% The "native AR overlay" rendered when the user taps <model-viewer>'s
%% built-in AR icon (ARCore scene-viewer on Android / ARKit QuickLook on
%% iOS / WebXR on desktop) lives OUTSIDE the WebView's DOM in a native
%% platform surface - the HTML scene receives no events from it until
%% the user returns and taps the HTML overlay's "배치 완료" button.
%%
%% Sources of truth:
%%   src/mobile/App.tsx                                      (FR-2 / AC-8 / AC-18 / AC-40)
%%   src/mobile/src/screens/RecommendationScreen.tsx         (FR-1 / AC-7 / AC-34..AC-36)
%%   src/mobile/src/screens/ARPlacementScreen.tsx            (FR-4..FR-10 / AC-17..AC-32 / AC-39)
%%   src/mobile/src/ar/ARWebView.tsx                         (D-7 - testable forwardRef wrapper)
%%   src/mobile/src/ar/bridge.ts                             (FR-3 / AC-9 / AC-19 / AC-43 / AC-30)
%%   src/mobile/assets/ar/placement.html                     (FR-11 / AC-10..AC-16 / AC-42 / AC-44)
%%   src/mobile/src/api/wishlist.ts                          (reused from UC-02 - NOT modified)
%%
%% PRD refs:
%%   section 4 (Unity AR Foundation - downgraded to Option C per D-1, flagged in README)
%%   section 6 UC-01 "미리보기" aspiration (this task implements the preview surface)
%%   section 8 sequence template (user -> frontend -> backend - here the "backend" is the scene DOM)

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Rec as RecommendationScreen (RN)<br/>ItemCard.btn-ar-{fid}<br/>FR-1 / AC-7 / AC-34..AC-36
    participant Nav as RN Navigator<br/>RootStackParamList.ARPlacement<br/>FR-2 / AC-8 / AC-18 / AC-40
    participant Scr as ARPlacementScreen (RN)<br/>status: loading|live|placed|cancelled|error<br/>FR-5..FR-10 / AC-17..AC-32
    participant Wv as ARWebView.tsx<br/>forwardRef wrapper<br/>onMessage + inject(raw)<br/>D-7
    participant Br as bridge.ts<br/>encodeInbound / decodeOutbound<br/>AR_BRIDGE_VERSION=1<br/>FR-3 / AC-9 / AC-19 / AC-43
    participant Html as placement.html<br/>model-viewer @3.5.0 CDN<br/>window.__authenticSelfBridgeLoad<br/>FR-11 / AC-10..AC-16 / AC-44
    participant NativeAR as Native AR overlay<br/>(ARCore scene-viewer / ARKit QuickLook / WebXR)<br/>OUTSIDE WebView DOM
    participant Wl as api/wishlist.ts<br/>addToWishlist (UC-02 - REUSED, NOT MODIFIED)

    Note over User,Wl: Precondition - UC-01 recommendations rendered; item is a RecommendationItem from nav params.

    %% ==========================================================
    %% (A) Entry + scene load  -  FR-1 / FR-2 / FR-5 / FR-11
    %% ==========================================================
    rect rgba(204,229,255,0.30)
    Note over Rec,Html: (A) Entry + scene load - FR-1 / FR-5 / AC-7 / AC-21 / AC-44
    User->>Rec: tap [AR로 배치] (testID=btn-ar-{furnitureId})
    Rec->>Nav: navigation.navigate('ARPlacement', { roomId, item })
    Nav->>Scr: mount with route.params = { roomId, item }
    Scr->>Scr: useState status='loading', errorCode=null
    Scr->>Scr: useMemo loadPayload = encodeInbound({<br/>bridgeVersion:1, event:'load',<br/>furnitureId, modelUrl=asset:///ar/models/{type}.glb,<br/>roomDimensions=DEFAULT_DIMENSIONS_BY_TYPE[type],<br/>colorHex=null })  (AC-20)
    Scr->>Wv: render ARWebView sourceUri='asset:///ar/placement.html'<br/>testID='ar-webview' (AC-21)
    Wv->>Html: WebView loads bundled HTML asset
    Html->>Html: fetch model-viewer.min.js @ 3.5.0 CDN (AC-12)<br/>install window.__authenticSelfBridgeLoad (AC-44)<br/>btnPlace.disabled=true
    Scr->>Scr: useEffect setStatus('live')
    Scr->>Wv: webviewRef.inject(loadPayload)
    Wv->>Html: injectJavaScript → window.__authenticSelfBridgeLoad(JSON)
    Html->>Br: bridgeVersion check (must be 1)
    Html->>Html: viewer.setAttribute('src', modelUrl)<br/>setTimeout 0 → probe viewer.canActivateAR
    Html-->>Html: model-viewer 'load' event → btnPlace.disabled=false
    end

    %% ==========================================================
    %% (B) Placement + wishlist add  -  FR-7 / FR-9
    %% ==========================================================
    rect rgba(230,245,220,0.30)
    Note over User,Wl: (B) Placement + wishlist add - FR-7 / FR-9 / AC-22..AC-24 / AC-28 / AC-30 / AC-31
    opt user taps model-viewer AR icon (supported device)
        User->>Html: tap built-in [AR 보기] icon
        Html->>NativeAR: dispatch AR via ar-modes="webxr scene-viewer quick-look"
        Note over NativeAR: Native AR overlay renders OUTSIDE the WebView DOM.<br/>HTML scene receives NO events from placement gestures;<br/>user returns to WebView by closing the overlay.
        NativeAR-->>Html: ar-status event (session-started / not-presenting)
    end
    User->>Html: tap [배치 완료] (HTML overlay, #btn-place)
    Html->>Wv: window.ReactNativeWebView.postMessage(<br/>JSON.stringify({bridgeVersion:1, event:'placed',<br/>pose:{x:0,y:0,z:0,yaw:0}}))  (AC-16 / v1 pose static per FR-11)
    Wv->>Br: decodeOutbound(raw)
    Br-->>Wv: OutboundARPlacedMessage
    Wv->>Scr: props.onMessage(msg)
    Scr->>Scr: handlePlaced → setStatus('placed')
    Scr->>Br: emitArFurniturePlaced(roomId, item.furnitureId, pose)  (AC-30 - exactly once)
    Scr->>User: Alert.alert('배치 완료',<br/>'위시리스트에 추가하시겠습니까?',<br/>[위시리스트에 추가 | 닫기])  (AC-22 / AC-23)
    alt User taps [위시리스트에 추가]
        Scr->>Wl: addToWishlist({baseUrl, userId,<br/>furnitureId, category:item.type, price:item.price})  (AC-24)
        Wl-->>Scr: { alreadyExists, status }
        alt fresh add
            Scr->>User: toast '위시리스트에 담았어요.' (WISHLIST_TOAST_COPY.SUCCESS_NEW)
        else alreadyExists && status=Active
            Scr->>User: toast '이미 위시리스트에 있어요.' (SUCCESS_EXISTS_ACTIVE)
        else alreadyExists && status=Purchased
            Scr->>User: toast '이미 구매 완료로 표시된 항목이에요.' (SUCCESS_EXISTS_PURCHASED)
        else ApiError FURNITURE_NOT_FOUND | USER_NOT_FOUND
            Scr->>User: toast '위시리스트에 추가하지 못했어요.' (FAIL_API)
        else network / other
            Scr->>User: toast '네트워크 오류로 추가하지 못했어요.' (FAIL_NETWORK)
        end
        Scr->>Nav: navigation.goBack()  (AC-28)
    else User taps [닫기]
        Note over Scr: No wishlist call; dismiss is style='cancel'.
        Scr->>Nav: navigation.goBack()  (AC-28)
    end
    end

    %% ==========================================================
    %% (C) Cancelled branch  -  FR-8
    %% ==========================================================
    rect rgba(255,236,204,0.30)
    Note over User,Nav: (C) Cancelled branch - FR-8 / AC-25
    User->>Html: tap [취소] (HTML overlay, #btn-cancel)
    Html->>Wv: postMessage({bridgeVersion:1, event:'cancelled'})
    Wv->>Br: decodeOutbound
    Br-->>Wv: OutboundARCancelledMessage
    Wv->>Scr: onMessage
    Scr->>Scr: handleCancelled → setStatus('cancelled')
    Scr->>Nav: navigation.goBack()  (AC-25 - no Alert, no addToWishlist)
    end

    %% ==========================================================
    %% (D) Error branches  -  FR-6
    %% ==========================================================
    rect rgba(253,218,218,0.30)
    Note over Html,User: (D) Error branches - FR-6 / AC-26 / AC-27 / AC-32<br/>Four codes: AR_NOT_SUPPORTED, AR_CAMERA_DENIED,<br/>AR_MODEL_LOAD_FAILED, AR_SESSION_ERROR
    alt capability probe - viewer.canActivateAR === false
        Html->>Wv: postMessage({event:'error', errorCode:'AR_NOT_SUPPORTED'})
    else camera permission DOMException
        Html->>Wv: window.error /NotAllowedError|camera|permission/ →<br/>postMessage({event:'error', errorCode:'AR_CAMERA_DENIED'})
    else model-viewer 'error' event (fetch/parse fail)
        Html->>Wv: postMessage({event:'error', errorCode:'AR_MODEL_LOAD_FAILED'})
    else ar-status=failed or scene init throw
        Html->>Wv: postMessage({event:'error', errorCode:'AR_SESSION_ERROR'})
    else RN-side decodeOutbound throws (bridgeVersion drift)
        Note over Wv: ARWebView.onDecodeError routes to handleError('AR_SESSION_ERROR') - FR-3 contract-drift guard
    end
    Wv->>Br: decodeOutbound
    Br-->>Wv: OutboundARErrorMessage {errorCode}
    Wv->>Scr: onMessage → handleError(code)
    Scr->>Scr: setErrorCode(code); setStatus('error')<br/>→ render branch switches (inlined fallback, §13 deviation)
    Note over Scr: ar-webview testID REMOVED (AC-27).<br/>ar-fallback testID rendered with AR_ERROR_COPY[code] +<br/>[btn-ar-back | '돌아가기'] (AC-26 / AC-39)
    User->>Scr: tap [돌아가기] (testID=btn-ar-back)
    Scr->>Nav: navigation.goBack()  (AC-32)
    end

    %% ==========================================================
    %% (E) Teardown on unmount  -  FR-10
    %% ==========================================================
    rect rgba(230,230,230,0.40)
    Note over Scr,Html: (E) Teardown on unmount - FR-10 / AC-29
    Scr->>Scr: cleanup useEffect fires
    Scr->>Br: encodeInbound({bridgeVersion:1, event:'unload'})
    Scr->>Wv: webviewRef.current?.inject(unloadJson)
    Wv->>Html: injectJavaScript → __authenticSelfBridgeLoad({event:'unload'})
    Html->>Html: viewer.removeAttribute('src'); btnPlace.disabled=true
    Scr->>Scr: webviewRef.current = null
    Note over Scr: jest.getTimerCount() === 0 (AC-29).<br/>No setTimeout / setInterval on the RN side.
    end
